  "response": "I\u2019ll check the relevant Greybeard skill and apply the confirmed rollout guidance. I won\u2019t change anything.\n\n\n1. **Baseline:** Record current settings, assignments, grace periods, and rollback steps.\n2. **Check access:** Review dependent Conditional Access policies, test sign-in paths, and verify recovery access.\n3. **Contain the pilot:** Verify membership and overlapping assignments. Editing a broadly assigned policy won\u2019t limit changes to a pilot.\n4. **Pilot for 72 hours:** Monitor compliance, resource access, and support incidents.\n5. **Require helpdesk review before expanding**, then roll out in stages with manual checkpoints.\n6. **Stop on unexpected impact:** Restore recorded settings and targeting, then verify access recovery.\n\nGreybeard confirmed memory **#2** says \u201ckeep the pilot for 72 hours and require helpdesk review before expanding\u201d; that determines steps 4\u20135.\n\nNo tenant state was checked or changed; pilot containment remains unverified.",
